<section class="panel-stack <%= panelClass('embed') %>" data-panel="embed">
  <article class="card section-panel">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Embed & Notice</p>
        <h3>임베드 및 공지</h3>
        <p class="muted">Components V2를 기본값으로 사용하며, 기존 임베드 형식도 선택할 수 있습니다.</p>
      </div>
      <label class="field toggle section-toggle">
        <input type="checkbox" form="embed-settings-form" name="embedEnabled" <%= settings.embed.enabled !== false ? 'checked' : '' %> />
        <span>임베드 기능 활성화</span>
      </label>
    </div>
    <form class="settings-form" id="embed-settings-form" method="post" action="/guild/<%= guild.id %>/settings/embed" data-embed-form>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label class="field">
          <span>전송 형식</span>
          <select name="embedMode" data-embed-mode>
            <option value="components" <%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Components V2</option>
            <option value="legacy" <%= settings.embed.mode === 'legacy' ? 'selected' : '' %>>기존 임베드</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>전송 채널 검색</span>
          <input type="search" placeholder="채널 이름으로 검색" data-channel-search="embed-channel-select" />
          <select id="embed-channel-select" name="embedChannelId" data-embed-channel>
            <option value="">전송할 채널 선택</option>
            <% channels.text.forEach((channel) => { %>
              <option value="<%= channel.id %>" <%= settings.embed.channelId === channel.id ? 'selected' : '' %>> <%= channel.label %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>제목</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedTitle" value="<%= settings.embed.title %>" data-embed-preview="title" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>색상</span>
          <input type="color" name="embedColor" value="<%= settings.embed.color %>" data-embed-preview="color" />
        </label>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>설명</span>
          <textarea name="embedDescription" rows="4" data-embed-preview="description"><%= settings.embed.description %></textarea>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>푸터</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedFooter" value="<%= settings.embed.footer %>" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>작성자 이름</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedAuthorName" value="<%= settings.embed.authorName %>" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>작성자 링크</span>
          <input type="url" name="embedAuthorUrl" value="<%= settings.embed.authorUrl %>" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>썸네일 URL</span>
          <input type="url" name="embedThumbnailUrl" value="<%= settings.embed.thumbnailUrl %>" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>이미지 URL</span>
          <input type="url" name="embedImageUrl" value="<%= settings.embed.imageUrl %>" />
        </label>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>Components V2 요소 입력</span>
          <textarea name="embedComponentsBody" rows="8"><%= settings.embed.componentsBody %></textarea>
          <small class="muted">입력한 순서대로 배치됩니다. 일반 문장은 Text Display, `---` 또는 `___` 한 줄은 실선, 빈 줄은 줄바꿈으로 처리됩니다.</small>
        </label>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>기존 임베드 필드(JSON)</span>
          <textarea name="embedFields" rows="4"><%= JSON.stringify(settings.embed.fields || []) %></textarea>
          <small class="muted">예: [{"name":"안내","value":"내용","inline":true}] 형식으로 최대 25개까지 입력할 수 있습니다.</small>
        </label>
        <label class="field check-field">
          <input type="checkbox" name="embedMentionEveryone" <%= settings.embed.mentionEveryone ? 'checked' : '' %> />
          <span>@everyone 멘션</span>
        </label>
        <label class="field check-field">
          <input type="checkbox" name="embedMentionHere" <%= settings.embed.mentionHere ? 'checked' : '' %> />
          <span>@here 멘션</span>
        </label>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>멘션할 역할 ID</span>
          <textarea name="embedMentionRoleIds" rows="2"><%= (settings.embed.mentionRoleIds || []).join('\n') %></textarea>
          <small class="muted">역할 ID를 줄바꿈 또는 쉼표로 입력하면 해당 역할을 멘션합니다.</small>
        </label>
        <label class="field check-field">
          <input type="checkbox" name="embedScheduleEnabled" <%= settings.embed.scheduleEnabled ? 'checked' : '' %> />
          <span>주기적으로 자동 전송</span>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>전송 주기(분)</span>
          <input type="number" min="1" max="10080" name="embedScheduleIntervalMinutes" value="<%= settings.embed.scheduleIntervalMinutes %>" />
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="form-actions">
        <button class="primary" type="submit">설정 저장</button>
        <button class="ghost" type="button" data-embed-send data-send-url="/guild/<%= guild.id %>/embed/send">지금 전송</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </article>
  <aside class="preview-column">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="section-head compact">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Live Preview</p><h3>임베드 미리보기</h3></div>
      </div>
      <div class="discord-preview" data-embed-preview-card>
        <div class="preview-bar"></div>
        <div class="preview-body">
          <h4 data-embed-preview-title><%= settings.embed.title %></h4>
          <p data-embed-preview-description><%= settings.embed.description %></p>
          <div class="preview-footer"><span><%= guild.name %></span><span data-embed-preview-time>방금 전</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted preview-help">전송 완료 시 화면 오른쪽 아래에 완료 팝업이 표시됩니다.</p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
